L1 Knowledge Base - Issue 3 (Copilot Access Concern)
v 1.0, 07/08/2026, status : Draft

Issue
Copilot showed a client matter you believe you should not access.

Reassurance
You did the right thing by reporting this. The support team will review it as a priority.

What you can safely do
1. Stop opening that matter or related links.
2. Capture a screenshot of what was shown.
3. Note exact time and what you typed before the result.
4. Do not forward or share the content.
5. Contact the Service Desk immediately.

Details to provide in the ticket
- Full name
- Team and floor/location
- Exact time it happened
- Text entered before result appeared
- Matter name or identifier shown
- Where it appeared (app/surface)
- Screenshot/photo (if possible)

Contact the service desk if...
Copilot shows any matter you believe you should not access.
